The shoulder pain has resolved, you’re feeling much better, and you think you’re ready to get back to sport… but @tindequipment shows the truth! 16% less force production in the dominant shoulder means we’re not done yet. 

@tindequipment helps us objectively measure your progress to ensure we’re getting you back to doing what you love, more resilient than you were before coming in to see us! 💪🧗‍♂️🏋️🏌️🤾🏊

