@leovilha_ VS @lesfreresmawemofficiel 🤙🏻 that’s a challenge ! An incredible moment. A little challenge with this Brazilian climber using just the thumb and pinky on the Battle Challenge.

The Mawem brothers took the win, but with a little bit of cheating because Léo can’t really bend his pinky finger. He can resist with it, but actually closing the gripper is seriously hard for him.

But no excuses. We give it everything we’ve got.#climbing #paraclimbing #parasport #brasil
